{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"eb903157-6eb9-4dd8-8710-2e428622c046","agentId":"a6c24b41b58cd6945","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"调研 Reformulation-Linearization Technique (RLT) 和 Lift-and-Project 在 2D placement / 二次约束问题上的应用。\n\n**背景：** RLT 是 Sherali-Adams 系列的实用工具，把二次/双线性约束线性化得更紧。我们项目可能有二次形式（端口连接 × 设施位置），RLT 可能给 LP 松弛收紧。\n\n**调研重点（≤800 字）：**\n1. RLT 基础 + Sherali-Adams 层级\n2. 实用 RLT 工具（PySAT、Pyomo 扩展）\n3. CP-SAT add_rlt_cuts 参数\n4. 对 placement / packing 的应用\n5. 跟 Combinatorial Benders 的关系\n\n输出末尾：\"对我们项目可行性\"。"},"uuid":"fdd787af-d440-4048-b1b7-dbcda0767582","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:06:12.385Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
